  "goodToKnow": "Der Chefredakteur (die Chefredakteurin) is the editor-in-chief of a newspaper, magazine or broadcaster. Der Redakteur is a staff editor or journalist, and die Redaktion is the editorial team or newsroom: Die Redaktion hat entschieden. Note the French-style pronunciation: SHEF-re-dak-TÖR. In German newspapers, the person legally responsible for content is listed in the Impressum as V.i.S.d.P. (verantwortlich im Sinne des Presserechts). Plural: die Chefredakteure."
